  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be continuous</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Using expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
